<li>S-2, Master of Science (M.Sc.) in Civil Engineering (Ocean/Coastal Engineering), The George Washington University, USA, 1983</li>
<li>S-3, Doctor of Philosophy (Ph.D) in Civil Engineering (Ocean/Coastal Engineering), North Carolina State University, Raleigh, NC USA, 1992</li>
</ul>
